@ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5170
# Must match Security:ApiKey when one is set (ingestion and document endpoints only).
@ApiKey = 

### Ingest a web page (returns a jobId)
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/scrape
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/" }

### Crawl a site from a page: same host and path, robots.txt honoured, each page its own document (max Rag:MaxCrawlPages)
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/scrape
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/", "maxPages": 20 }

### Upload a file (txt/csv/docx/xlsx/pdf)
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/upload
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="company_profile.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./testdata/company_profile.txt
--boundary--

### Job status (replace with a jobId from above)
GET {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### List ingested documents
GET {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Delete a document and its chunks (source = file name or URL, URL-encoded)
DELETE {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/documents?source=company_profile.txt
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Ask a question
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/chat/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When was the company founded?" }

### Follow-up question: send earlier turns as history (the server stores no conversation)
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/chat/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "And where is the head office?",
  "history": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "When was the company founded?" },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "The company was founded in 2016 [1]." }
  ]
}

### Streamed answer (Server-Sent Events: sources, context, delta..., done | error); also accepts history
POST {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/api/chat/ask/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When was the company founded?" }

### Health
GET {{ChatBotRAGAPI_HostAddress}}/health
